**README.md documents Local XLive offline storage layout and profile-import behavior.**

## Storage

`storage/profiles/<16-digit XUID>/settings/41560829/{63E83FFD,63E83FFE,63E83FFF}.bin` stores raw title settings; `title_storage/<facility>/<item name>` stores `XStorageUploadFromMemory`/`XStorageDownloadToMemory` payloads.

## Import

`%LOCALAPPDATA%\Microsoft\Xlive\Content\41560829.gpd` is validated as little-endian `FBDX`/`XDBF`; namespace 3 settings import only when absent locally.

## Profile Selection

`name` dvar, CLI `name`/`-set name`, deterministically generates XUID; changing `name` selects another profile.